MinerU and MinerU2.5-Pro
-----------------------
SolidCog uses MinerU2.5-Pro model weights for local document parsing. The model
weights are distributed under Apache License 2.0 by OpenDataLab. SolidCog does
not include or relicense these weights; setup downloads them from the original
repository.

The MinerU project is licensed under the MinerU Open Source License, which
includes additional attribution terms. SolidCog displays "Powered by MinerU" in
the README and application interface.
https://github.com/opendatalab/MinerU/blob/master/LICENSE.md

