MechVL-4B-RL
------------
SolidCog uses MechVL-4B-RL for local mechanical drawing question answering.
The model is distributed by its original authors under Apache License 2.0.
SolidCog does not include or relicense its weights; setup downloads them from
the original repository. MechVL-4B-RL is based on Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct.
https://huggingface.co/XiaofengAlg/MechVL-4B-RL

Qwen VL / DashScope
-------------------
SolidCog offers an optional cloud OCR path using Qwen VL through Alibaba Cloud
DashScope. When this path is selected, document page images are sent to the
service. The applicable Alibaba Cloud service terms govern its use.

Python dependencies and other third-party components remain subject to their
respective licenses and service terms.
